====== AVM FRITZ!Box Fon WLAN 7360 (SL) ======
<WRAP center dangerous 70%>
**Warning!**\\
Not all FRITZ!Box 7360 v1 and SL models are properly labeled. Make sure to verify your model with HWRevision</WRAP>

This box is using a Lantiq SoC, see [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.lantiq]]
The box is currently supported as "stable" in LEDE since 17.01 (reboot).

The DECT does not work and is not supported due to missing PIGLET and DECT Driver (AVM driver is closed source).
If you need DECT and/ or fully phone support, you should take a look at [[http://freetz.org/|freetz]].

Phone works only via SIP with asterisk or another SIP package and a wifi or ethernet SIP phone.

{{:media:avm:fritzbox_7360:fritzbox_7360_sl_general_view.png?200|AVM FRITZ!Box 7360 SL}}    {{:media:avm:fritzbox_7360:fritzbox_7360_sl_1_1-home-server_general_view.jpg?200|}}

